{"channelId":"UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","row":["Rehab Hero",29500,"Dr. David Song, DC • Chiropractor • Learn How to Maneuver Through Your Journey to Recovery\n\nHi everyone! I am a Doctor of Chiropractic (DC) who focuses on teaching people how to incorporate rehabilitation into their active lifestyles using movements and exercises that reduce pain, improve recovery, and move better.\n\nThis channel supports aims to get you to move pain-free. Subscribe to this channel to learn about how to navigate through the complexities of injuries while still maintaining your fitness & health. This channel has content covering exercise rehabilitation, biomechanics, form correction, and functional training. Take ownership over your injury by getting the education needed to succeed in recovery. \n\nIf you live in Toronto, book an in-person visit at my clinics at www.rehabhero.ca","sheppard@rehabhero.ca; woodbine@rehabhero.ca","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:22:41.979Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:22:41.979Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":29500,"raw":"29.5K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNBaCaOlUrhrm8MeTv_O1FQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:43.767Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"sheppard@rehabhero.ca","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.rehabhero.ca/","https://www.rehabhero.ca/team","https://www.rehabhero.ca/careers"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:507cec3ff392237207d68088","public-page:3176e3b99961006fa837564e","public-page:3fa8bb0af36f9ef4daface81"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:21.239Z","deliver